# Python PATH

Windows Store stub (`WindowsApps\python.exe`) is not Python. Real exe is `AI_VIDEO_PYTHON` in `scripts/.env`.

First shell of every session, before any `python` call:

```powershell
powershell -File scripts/load_agent_path.ps1
```

Then `python` works. Do not hunt interpreters. Do not announce "python missing from PATH".

```
# ❌ BAD
python scripts/foo.py
# fails, then search PATH, then retry

# ✅ GOOD
powershell -File scripts/load_agent_path.ps1
python scripts/foo.py
```
